      "message": "As I mentioned in the meeting, this should only be accessible to ROOT and SHELL. Hence there is no need for additional permission checks. (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/base/core/java/android/os/Binder.java;l\u003d1101-1113;drc\u003d910c4f25d7ce7e0f6d74dd7662355a76ffbcf6e2)",
